<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's o/n rates edge up to 21.125 percent.</title>
<headline>Hungary's o/n rates edge up to 21.125 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's overnight interest rates edged up to 0.125 percent in average trade on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The overnight rates traded between 20.75 and 21.25 percent and closed at 21.125 percent, up from 21.00 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Traders added that with no major market-moving factors in sight, the rates would probably hover around current levels for the rest of the week.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
